==Strategy==
An easy stage. Stack up [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] on the opening peons, then just swarm Baron Face with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] and [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]] while he's Frozen for an easy win. Be wary of enemy scaling, as things ramp up fairly quickly.

