==Strategy==
Stack up [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] on Those Guys and Madam Peng. Once Malizabeth makes her way to the frontlines, kill her with [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] to hopefully allow your Green Nyanko Rangers to permafreeze Archbaron Face. At this point, spam [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] alongside the occasional Red Nyanko Ranger to handle Malizabeth. Even as Archbaron Face is knocked back, he'll usually just be frozen again by your Green Nyanko Rangers again.
